      ],
      "en": "Then I went to the Euphrates, and dug, and took the belt from the place where I had hidden it; and behold, the belt was ruined. It was profitable for nothing.",
      "ko": "내가 유브라데로 가서 그 감추었던 곳을 파고 띠를 취하니 띠가 썩어서 쓸데 없이 되었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "5edda845c5139877e755107426a1009f37b52edcb4621d5f0d5331367c86e8d8",
      "translation_text_hash": "3b5103075c868db84ae5e57f43b39220dc1d4366a8b1428d4b11586243fa8b29",
