      "en": "Lift up your eyes, and see those who come from the north. Where is the flock that was given to you, your beautiful flock?",
      "ko": "너는 눈을 들어 북방에서 오는 자들을 보라 네가 받았던 떼, 네 아름다운 양떼는 어디 있느뇨",
      "source_text_hash": "25a284c4d9fca475f3e19c9c93d59de0a87742aadaf0357475b78e0ef09aaa39",
